["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalRefType/nuget", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "A reference to a NuGet package. The package locator format is defined in the [NuGet documentation](https://docs.nuget.org) and looks like `package/version`.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
